    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25966" root="ضلع" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَالِعٌ</span></b>  <i>Inclining,</i> or <i>declining:</i> (TA: [like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِالِعٌ</span>:]) <i>declining,</i> or <i>deviating, from that which
is right,</i> or <i>true: acting wrongfully, unjustly, injuriously,</i> or <i>tyrannically.</i> (S, O, K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَلِعٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see 1, in the last quarter
of the paragraph.

